            "tool_id": "T1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "OP10.3",
          "type": "helical_hole_milling",
          "text": "用 T1 在面铣剩料上螺旋铣 H1：孔心 (3, 2)，φ2 贯穿；中心不得留芯，沿用原 CAD 坐标。",
          "source": {
            "document_id": "CARD",
            "page": 2,
            "location": "工序 / 工步 OP10.3"
